<template compat="shopify">
{%- liquid
  assign color_scheme = section.settings.color_scheme.id | default: section.settings.color_scheme | default: 'default-color-scheme'
-%}
<style>
  {%- case section.settings.section_width -%}
    {%- when 'container' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .container {
        max-width: calc(var(--page-width, 1300px) + 3rem) !important;
        margin-inline: auto !important;
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box !important;
      }
    {%- when 'fluid_container' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fluid_container {
        max-width: calc(var(--fluid-container-width, 1500px) + 3rem) !important;
        margin-inline: auto !important;
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box !important;
      }
    {%- when 'stretch_width' -%}
      @media (min-width: 1200px) {
        #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .stretch_width { padding-inline: 3rem; }
      }
    {%- when 'full_width' -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}</style>
{%- assign fb_accessibility_after = 'accessibility.after' | t -%}
{%- assign fb_accessibility_before = 'accessibility.before' | t -%}
{%- comment -%} Materia: connect this section to the theme-level animation settings (settings.scroll_animation / animation_duration / animation_delay). {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.scroll_animation != blank and settings.scroll_animation != 'none' -%}
<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }}.scroll-trigger {
    --animation-duration: {{ settings.animation_duration | default: 700 }}ms;
    --animation-delay: {{ settings.animation_delay | default: 0 }}ms;
  }
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}</style>
<script>
  (function(){
    var el = document.getElementById('shopify-section-{{ section.id }}');
    if (!el || el.classList.contains('scroll-trigger')) return;
    el.classList.add('scroll-trigger', {{ settings.scroll_animation | json }});
  })();
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}</script>
{%- endif -%}
<style data-rs-bulletproof>
  {%- if section.settings.reset_spacing -%}
    /* reset_spacing: bulletproof override of ALL section spacing mechanisms */
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }},
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} > .section,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} > section,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} > div,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} > div > .section {
      margin-top: 0 !important;
      margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} + .shopify-section,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} + section,
    .shopify-section + #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      margin-top: 0 !important;
    }
  {%- endif -%}
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}</style>
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes — Before And After Reveal
  Centered hero section with an optional trust bar (Trustpilot-style stars
  OR overlapping customer-avatar proof), heading, subheading, button, and
  two side-by-side before / after images joined by a stylable arrow with
  optional animation. All content is reorderable blocks.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign st  = section.settings
  assign sid = section.id
  assign placeholder = 'https://2dbags.co/wp-content/uploads/revslider/lookbook1-demo_slider/placeholder.jpg'

  assign before_block = nil
  assign after_block  = nil
  for b in section.blocks
    if b.type == 'before' and before_block == nil
      assign before_block = b
    endif
    if b.type == 'after' and after_block == nil
      assign after_block = b
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    The Trust bar / avatar styling now lives ON the Trust bar block (tb) instead
    of the section, so every trust control sits in one place. `tb` is nil-safe:
    if there's no Trust bar block, the defaults below apply harmlessly.
  endcomment
  assign trust_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'trust' | first
  assign tb = trust_block.settings
-%}

<style>
  /* Section isolation */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} { isolation: isolate; position: relative; }
  :where(#shopify-section-{{ sid }}) { font-family: var(--body-font, inherit); }
  :where(#shopify-section-{{ sid }}) :is(h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6) { font-family: var(--heading-font, inherit); }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} *, #shopify-section-{{ sid }} *:before, #shopify-section-{{ sid }} *:after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  /* Margins */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} {
    margin-top: {{ st.section_margin_top_mobile | default: 0 }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ st.section_margin_bottom_mobile | default: 0 }}px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} {
      margin-top: {{ st.section_margin_top_desktop | default: 0 }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ st.section_margin_bottom_desktop | default: 0 }}px;
    }
  }
  {%- if st.reset_spacing -%}
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} { margin-top: 0 !important; margin-bottom: 0 !important; }
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} + .shopify-section { margin-top: 0 !important; }
  {%- endif -%}

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar {
    background: {% render 'scheme-color', color: st.section_bg, fallback: 'var(--color-background)' %} !important;
    padding-top: {{ st.padding_top_mobile | default: 56 }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ st.padding_bottom_mobile | default: 56 }}px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar {
      padding-top: {{ st.padding_top_desktop | default: 96 }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ st.padding_bottom_desktop | default: 96 }}px;
    }
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__inner {
    max-width: {{ st.section_max_width_desktop | default: 1100 }}px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ st.header_gap | default: 16 }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ st.gap_header_images | default: 56 }}px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__header > * { margin: 0; max-width: 720px; }

  /* Trust bar */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__trust {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: {% render 'scheme-color', color: tb.rating_text_color, fallback: 'var(--color-text)' %};
    font-size: {{ tb.rating_text_size | default: 14 }}px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__avatars {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__av-stack {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__av {
    width: {{ tb.avatar_size | default: 41 }}px;
    height: {{ tb.avatar_size | default: 41 }}px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: {{ tb.avatar_border_width | default: 2 }}px solid {% render 'scheme-color', color: tb.avatar_border_color, fallback: 'var(--color-background)' %};
    background: {% render 'scheme-color', color: tb.avatar_placeholder_bg, fallback: 'var(--color-border)' %};
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-left: -{{ tb.avatar_overlap | default: 18 }}px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__av:last-child { margin-left: 0; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__av img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

  /* Images row — uses CSS Grid where the arrow occupies the same center
     cell as part of the images via position absolute overlay so it sits ON
     TOP of the cards (z-index above) rather than between them. */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__images {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ st.images_gap_mobile | default: 8 }}px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    max-width: {{ st.images_max_width | default: 900 }}px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__images { gap: {{ st.images_gap_desktop | default: 24 }}px; }
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__img-card {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: {{ st.image_aspect | default: '1 / 1' }};
    border-radius: {{ st.image_radius | default: 18 }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: {% render 'scheme-color', color: st.image_bg, fallback: 'var(--color-border)' %};
    z-index: 1;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__img-card img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__img-card--before { transform: rotate({{ st.before_rotate | default: -3 }}deg); }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__img-card--after  { transform: rotate({{ st.after_rotate  | default:  3 }}deg); }

  /* Arrow — overlay positioned absolutely in the center of the images row
     so it always sits ABOVE the images (z-index 5). Uses aspect-ratio so
     the box never collapses and overflow: visible so curved/animated
     arrows are never clipped. */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: {{ st.arrow_size_mobile | default: 80 }}px;
    aspect-ratio: 100 / 50;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    color: {% render 'scheme-color', color: st.arrow_color, fallback: 'var(--color-primary)' %};
    z-index: 5;
    pointer-events: none;
    line-height: 0;
    overflow: visible;
    display: block;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow {
      width: {{ st.arrow_size | default: 110 }}px;
    }
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    overflow: visible;
    transform-origin: center center;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  /* Arrow animations.
     The .bar__arrow wrapper is CENTRED with transform: translate(-50%,-50%).
     If the animation lived on .bar__arrow its keyframe transform would replace
     that centring and shove the arrow off to the right/down. So the animation
     runs on the inner <svg> instead — the wrapper stays perfectly centred and
     the arrow animates in place. */
  {%- case st.arrow_animation -%}
    {%- when 'pulse' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow svg { animation: ba-pulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
      @keyframes ba-pulse { 0%,100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.12); } }
    {%- when 'wiggle' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow svg { animation: ba-wiggle 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
      @keyframes ba-wiggle { 0%,100% { transform: rotate(-6deg); } 50% { transform: rotate(6deg); } }
    {%- when 'slide' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow svg { animation: ba-slide 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
      @keyframes ba-slide { 0%,100% { transform: translateX(-4px); } 50% { transform: translateX(4px); } }
    {%- when 'bounce' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow svg { animation: ba-bounce 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
      @keyframes ba-bounce { 0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-6px); } }
    {%- when 'spin' -%}
      #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow svg { animation: ba-spin 5s linear infinite; }
      @keyframes ba-spin { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  {%- endcase -%}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar__arrow svg { animation: none !important; }
  }

  /* Show / hide by device */
  {%- if st.show_section_on == 'mobile' -%}
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar { display: none; }
    @media (max-width: 767px) { #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar { display: block; } }
  {%- elsif st.show_section_on == 'desktop' -%}
    #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar { display: none; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) { #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .bar { display: block; } }
  {%- endif -%}
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}</style>

<section class="bar color-{{ color_scheme }} gradient {{ section.settings.section_width | default: 'full_width' }}" id="bar-{{ sid }}">
  <div class="bar__inner">

    {%- comment -%}========== HEADER (blocks: trust, heading, subheading, button) ==========={%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="bar__header">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- assign bs = block.settings -%}
        {%- case block.type -%}

          {%- when 'trust' -%}
            {%- if bs.show_avatars -%}
              <div class="bar__trust" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                <span class="bar__avatars">
                  <span class="bar__av-stack">
                    {%- comment -%}
                      Render the 4 avatar slots in reverse (4→1) so the first one
                      ends up on top of the overlapping stack. We read each slot
                      directly — the old version built an array with
                      `'' | split: ',' | concat: <image>`, but `concat` only joins
                      arrays, so the single image objects never entered it and
                      every slot fell through to the placeholder. That's why
                      uploaded avatars never showed.
                    {%- endcomment -%}
                    {%- for i in (1..4) reversed -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        case i
                          when 1
                            assign img = bs.avatar_1
                          when 2
                            assign img = bs.avatar_2
                          when 3
                            assign img = bs.avatar_3
                          when 4
                            assign img = bs.avatar_4
                        endcase
                      -%}
                      {%- if img != blank -%}
                        <span class="bar__av"><img src="{{ img | image_url: width: 120 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60"></span>
                      {%- elsif bs.show_placeholders -%}
                        <span class="bar__av"><img src="{{ placeholder }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60"></span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  </span>
                </span>
                {%- if bs.text != blank -%}<span>{{ bs.text }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'heading' -%}
            {%- if bs.text != blank -%}
              <{{ bs.tag | default: 'h2' }} id="block-{{ block.id }}" class="bar__heading" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ bs.text }}</{{ bs.tag | default: 'h2' }}>
              <style>
                #shopify-section-{{ sid }} #block-{{ block.id }} {
                  color: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.color, fallback: 'var(--color-heading)' %} !important;
                  {%- if bs.weight_enable -%}font-weight: {{ bs.weight | default: 800 }};{%- endif -%}
                  line-height: {{ bs.line_height | default: 1.1 }};
                  letter-spacing: {{ bs.tracking | default: 0 }}px;
                  font-size: {{ bs.size_mobile | default: 32 }}px;
                }
                @media (min-width: 768px) {
                  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} #block-{{ block.id }} { font-size: {{ bs.size_desktop | default: 48 }}px; }
                }
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}              </style>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'subheading' -%}
            {%- if bs.text != blank -%}
              <div id="block-{{ block.id }}" class="bar__sub" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ bs.text }}</div>
              <style>
                #shopify-section-{{ sid }} #block-{{ block.id }} {
                  color: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.color, fallback: 'var(--color-text)' %} !important;
                  font-size: {{ bs.size | default: 17 }}px;
                  {%- if bs.weight_enable -%}font-weight: {{ bs.weight | default: 400 }};{%- endif -%}
                  line-height: {{ bs.line_height | default: 1.55 }};
                  max-width: {{ bs.max_width | default: 640 }}px;
                  margin-inline: auto;
                }
                #shopify-section-{{ sid }} #block-{{ block.id }} > * { margin: 0; }
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}              </style>
            {%- endif -%}

          {%- when 'button' -%}
            {%- if bs.text != blank -%}
              <a id="block-{{ block.id }}" class="bar__btn" href="{{ bs.link | default: '/' }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ bs.text | escape }}</a>
              <style>
                #shopify-section-{{ sid }} #block-{{ block.id }} {
                  display: inline-flex;
                  align-items: center;
                  justify-content: center;
                  text-decoration: none;
                  background: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.bg, fallback: 'var(--btn-primary-bg-color)' %} !important;
                  color: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.color, fallback: 'var(--btn-primary-color)' %} !important;
                  {%- if bs.use_theme_button -%}
                  border: var(--btn-border-width, 1px) solid {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.border_color, fallback: 'var(--btn-primary-border-color)' %};
                  border-radius: var(--btn-radius, 8px);
                  font-size: var(--btn-font-size, 14px);
                  font-weight: var(--btn-font-weight, 500);
                  font-family: var(--btn-font, var(--body-font));
                  letter-spacing: var(--btn-letter-spacing, 0);
                  text-transform: var(--btn-text-transform, none);
                  padding: var(--btn-padding-y, 14px) var(--btn-padding-x, 26px);
                  {%- else -%}
                  border: {{ bs.border_width | default: 0 }}px solid {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.border_color, fallback: 'var(--btn-primary-border-color)' %};
                  border-radius: {{ bs.radius | default: 100 }}px;
                  font-size: {{ bs.size | default: 16 }}px;
                  {%- if bs.weight_enable -%}font-weight: {{ bs.weight | default: 700 }};{%- endif -%}
                  padding: {{ bs.pad_y | default: 14 }}px {{ bs.pad_x | default: 36 }}px;
                  {%- endif -%}
                  transition: background-color .25s ease, color .25s ease, transform .2s ease;
                }
                #shopify-section-{{ sid }} #block-{{ block.id }}:hover {
                  background: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.bg_hover, fallback: 'var(--btn-primary-hover-bg-color)' %} !important;
                  color: {% render 'scheme-color', color: bs.color_hover, fallback: 'var(--btn-primary-hover-color)' %} !important;
                }
{% comment %}{% endcomment %}              </style>
            {%- endif -%}

        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}========== IMAGES + ARROW ==========={%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="bar__images">
      <div class="bar__img-card bar__img-card--before"
           {% if before_block %}{{ before_block.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}>
        {%- if before_block and before_block.settings.image -%}
          <img src="{{ before_block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
               alt="{{ before_block.settings.alt | default: fb_accessibility_before | escape }}"
               loading="lazy"
               width="{{ before_block.settings.image.width }}" height="{{ before_block.settings.image.height }}">
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ placeholder }}" alt="{{ 'accessibility.before' | t }}" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <span class="bar__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        {%- case st.arrow_style -%}
          {%- when 'curved' -%}
            {%- comment -%} Cubic Bézier ending with horizontal tangent so the arrowhead sits flat. {%- endcomment -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 50" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="overflow:visible">
              <path d="M8 35 C 28 7 72 35 92 35"/>
              <polyline points="82 27 92 35 82 43"/>
            </svg>
          {%- when 'arrow-thin' -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 40" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="overflow:visible">
              <line x1="10" y1="20" x2="88" y2="20"/>
              <polyline points="78 11 90 20 78 29"/>
            </svg>
          {%- when 'chevron' -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="overflow:visible">
              <polyline points="22 14 40 30 22 46"/>
            </svg>
          {%- when 'double-chevron' -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="overflow:visible">
              <polyline points="14 14 30 30 14 46"/>
              <polyline points="32 14 48 30 32 46"/>
            </svg>
          {%- when 'sparkle' -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="overflow:visible">
              <path d="M30 6 L34 26 L54 30 L34 34 L30 54 L26 34 L6 30 L26 26 Z"/>
            </svg>
          {%- else -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 50" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="overflow:visible">
              <path d="M8 35 C 28 7 72 35 92 35"/>
              <polyline points="82 27 92 35 82 43"/>
            </svg>
        {%- endcase -%}
      </span>

      <div class="bar__img-card bar__img-card--after"
           {% if after_block %}{{ after_block.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}>
        {%- if after_block and after_block.settings.image -%}
          <img src="{{ after_block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
               alt="{{ after_block.settings.alt | default: fb_accessibility_after | escape }}"
               loading="lazy"
               width="{{ after_block.settings.image.width }}" height="{{ after_block.settings.image.height }}">
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ placeholder }}" alt="{{ 'accessibility.after' | t }}" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>



</template>

<schema>
{
  "type": "before-and-after-reveal",
  "name": "Before And After Reveal",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "id": "hdr_1",
      "label": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "Section width",
      "default": "full_width",
      "info": "Uses the page widths from Theme settings → Layout. This choice applies to this section only.",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "container",
          "label": "Default"
        },
        {
          "value": "fluid_container",
          "label": "Fluid container"
        },
        {
          "value": "stretch_width",
          "label": "Stretched"
        },
        {
          "value": "full_width",
          "label": "Full width"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "default-color-scheme",
      "info": "Uses Theme settings → Colors. Colour pickers below override this scheme. Leave a colour empty or fully transparent to use it."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "para_4",
      "label": "Width and colours follow Theme settings. Everything under this note overrides the theme for this section only.",
      "content": "Width and colours follow Theme settings. Everything under this note overrides the theme for this section only."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "reset_spacing",
      "label": "Remove default space between sections",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "id": "hdr_6",
      "label": "General"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "show_section_on",
      "label": "Show section on",
      "default": "all",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "all",
          "label": "All Devices"
        },
        {
          "value": "mobile",
          "label": "Only Mobile"
        },
        {
          "value": "desktop",
          "label": "Only Desktop"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_max_width_desktop",
      "label": "Section content width (desktop)",
      "min": 600,
      "max": 1500,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 1100
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "id": "hdr_9",
      "label": "Header layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_gap",
      "label": "Gap between header blocks",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
